  "_staging_note": "Staging drives the SAME beat the rubric scores, from the same file. 'hand-over' starts the worker's clock — timing rubrics measure from there, not from beat start, so our reveal pacing never counts as his hesitation. Only one attention-seeking cue may be live at a time; Choreographer warns at load if two overlap."
